      "writtenOn": "2022-08-31T02:39:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nice point!\n\nUnder BlueZ, it reports supported_profiles 0x10 , which proves what you said.\n\nUnder Floss stack, it seems correctly reported now. Printing out the remote_uuids only gave me hsp and hfp for HM1000. And we no longer trigger connection with it.\n\nNot sure which change fixed the hidden issue as this segment of code hasn\u0027t been changed for quite a while.",
      "parentUuid": "d733fd78_77a201de",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 519,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 519,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "c4cc913c2e0410ee6b873812194f30633b5aa95e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
