      "writtenOn": "2022-08-31T02:46:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "b/241816822 is the bug that makes me checked this. I shared the same feeling with you when I saw the code. \nFrom b/241816822\u0027s feedback report, it seems we used to regard the headset support both a2dp and hfp.\n\nDEV_ADDED                      a2dp supported and hfp supported with codec capability bitmask 2\n\nMight worth double checking other platforms, but no matter whether this is a platform specific behavior or simply a hidden issued fixed, we should file the bug and fix this by adding the HFP profile in `connect_all_enabled_profiles`.",
      "parentUuid": "4529ce9c_5109a621",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 519,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 519,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "c4cc913c2e0410ee6b873812194f30633b5aa95e",
